  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_01_botan_01",
      "hash64": "3D7ABE7875EFD1EF",
      "text": "这里就是帕底亚巨坑\\n里面的……第零区……[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_01_botan_02",
      "hash64": "3D7ABF7875EFD3A2",
      "text": "似乎比课本上的插图\\n看起来要厉害……[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_01_rival_01",
      "hash64": "149FE037010B010D",
      "text": "毕竟不能随便进来的嘛～[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_01_rival_02",
      "hash64": "149FDD37010AFBF4",
      "text": "咦……？\\n话说，[VAR 0x0101(0001)]跑哪儿去了？[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_01_friend_01",
      "hash64": "FF833EB53EF5EDDF",
      "text": "……它好像有点害怕，\\n回到球里去了。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_01_rival_03",
      "hash64": "149FDE37010AFDA7",
      "text": "不是吧～好担心啊。[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_01_botan_03",
      "hash64": "3D7AC07875EFD555",
      "text": "莫非没有它的话，\\n就没法回到上面去？[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_01_friend_02",
      "hash64": "FF833FB53EF5EF92",
      "text": "不，之前来的时候……[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_01_friend_03",
      "hash64": "FF8340B53EF5F145",
      "text": "我是哭着拜托飞翔出租车\\n来接我出去的。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_01_botan_04",
      "hash64": "3D7AB97875EFC970",
      "text": "如果博士在下面的话，\\n拜托博士不就好了？你们关系不好吗？[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_01_friend_04",
      "hash64": "FF8339B53EF5E560",
      "text": "就你嘴欠……\\n丫头，别得意忘形啊。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_01_botan_05",
      "hash64": "3D7ABA7875EFCB23",
      "text": "啊？别叫我丫头。\\n你生什么气啊。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_01_rival_04",
      "hash64": "149FDB37010AF88E",
      "text": "哎呀～多难得的大冒险，\\n大家好好享受吧！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
